  "startedAt": "2026-10-20T10:11:32.278Z",
  "steps": [
    "Source and target require explicit selection from the current form and saved scene directory. Copying onto the same instance/property fails while retaining reviewed bytes, field values and paused or running preview. Selecting choices and switching Chinese/English/Japanese at390px preserve review, selected full UUIDs and focused select nodes. Controls fit. Cancel writes no author files or source draft.",
    "Rust WASM copies the current unsaved sprite track to the selected second instance with a fresh UUID. Every existing track, clip, value and setting is preserved semantically, including the edited source frame and clip name. The new track retains the source grid and frame indices. Both schematic targets sample frame2. The result requires a fresh check/review, and cancelling that review writes nothing.",
    "Apply changes only the ordinary source draft. Ordinary Save writes exactly the reviewed BOM/CRLF animation. Scene documents, registrations, both distinct image assets, templates and every other author file retain their bytes.",
    "Saved scene preview freezes the exact copied document. Actual Canvas pixels show both instances cropping frame2, but the source is blue and the target orange from its own distinct image. Copying did not replace target resources. Preview makes no further author writes and no browser exceptions occurred."
  ],
